  "description": "ILLUSTRATIVE EXAMPLE — not real company or product data. Product-type passport for a recycled-HDPE non-pressure underground drainage pipe, 110 mm OD, ring stiffness class SN4 (illustrative). One passport per product type, as the construction DPP under Reg (EU) 2024/3110 is product-type level; batch passports reference it via productTypeRef (see example_pipe_batch_v02.jsonld). Declared performance characteristics (DoPC) belong to the construction profile overlay, which references EN ISO 23387 data templates rather than redefining them; they are not reproduced in the core passport. The pipe is three-layer (virgin outer and inner skins, recycled core); recycledContentDetail scopes the claim per layer and the aggregate recycledContent is the mass-weighted total. Module D is carried as an indicator, never as netAvoidedKgCo2ePerKg. Recycled-content figures are the declared minimum for the type, not a batch measurement.",
